    "text": "Lahore phir duniya ka sab se aloodah bara shehar, AQI 538! 😷\nDawn ke mutabiq Sunday subah IQAir ki live ranking mein Lahore ka AQI 9 se 10 baje ke darmiyan 538 raha, jo \"hazardous\" yani khatarnak darje mein aata hai. Doosre number par Delhi 207 ke sath tha, phir Karachi 180. Pakistan ke top 10 aloodah shehron mein Punjab ke 8 shehar shamil hain. Lahore traffic police ke mutabiq dhuan chhorne wali 14,653 gariyon ke challan kiye gaye.\nSmog se bachne ke liye aap kya ehtiyat karte hain? Comment mein batayein 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #LahoreSmog #AirQuality #Lahore #PakistanNews",
